# a design decision sub-question 2 (fractional fee arithmetic) and O7 (does the fee leak tier).
# Testnet 296. Tokens: GBPX 0.0.10321401 (no fee schedule key, so it
# can never have fees, used as the baseline) and GBPY 0.0.10321635 (25 bp).
# Every arm reports sender debited, recipient credited and collector credited,
# and every arm conserved.

--- setup finding, before any measurement ---
TokenFeeScheduleUpdate on GBPX returned TOKEN_HAS_NO_FEE_SCHEDULE_KEY.
A fee schedule key must be set at CREATION. There is no way to add one later.

--- rounding, 25 bp, min 0, floor confirmed across 10 amounts ---
  sent   exact fee   charged   recipient got   shortfall
  400000        1000      1000         399000        1000
   10000          25        25           9975          25
    4000          10        10           3990          10
     401      1.0025         1            400           1
     400           1         1            399           1
     399      0.9975         0            399           0
     100        0.25         0            100           0
      40         0.1         0             40           0
       4        0.01         0              4           0
       1      0.0025         0              1           0

--- baseline, a token that has no fee and structurally cannot ---
{"label":"BASELINE no-fee token, 399","sent":399,"senderDebited":399,"recipientCredited":399,"collectorCredited":0,"conserved":true}
{"label":"BASELINE no-fee token, 4000","sent":4000,"senderDebited":4000,"recipientCredited":4000,"collectorCredited":0,"conserved":true}

--- 25 bp, min 0 ---
{"label":"25bp min=0, 399 (below threshold)","sent":399,"senderDebited":399,"recipientCredited":399,"collectorCredited":0,"conserved":true}
{"label":"25bp min=0, 400 (at threshold)","sent":400,"senderDebited":400,"recipientCredited":399,"collectorCredited":1,"conserved":true}

--- 25 bp, min 1 ---
{"minimum":1}
{"label":"25bp min=1, 399","sent":399,"senderDebited":399,"recipientCredited":398,"collectorCredited":1,"conserved":true}
{"label":"25bp min=1, 1 unit","sent":1,"senderDebited":1,"recipientCredited":0,"collectorCredited":1,"conserved":true}
{"label":"25bp min=1, 4000 (min must not override)","sent":4000,"senderDebited":4000,"recipientCredited":3990,"collectorCredited":10,"conserved":true}

--- the fee schedule as the public sees it, /api/v1/tokens/0.0.10321635 ---
{"fixed_fees":[],"fractional_fees":[{"all_collectors_are_exempt":false,
 "amount":{"numerator":25,"denominator":10000},
 "collector_account_id":"0.0.10298158","denominating_token_id":"0.0.10321635",
 "maximum":null,"minimum":0,"net_of_transfers":false}]}

# Read:
#   fee = floor(amount * numerator / denominator), then max(fee, minimum).
#   net_of_transfers false, so the fee comes OUT of the amount and the recipient
#   receives amount - fee.
#   min 0  -> everything below denominator/numerator units moves free.
#   min 1  -> a 1 unit transfer delivers ZERO and does not revert.
